rm.'],['Kitsune','Mythical','Foxfire and swift transformation.'],['Gas','Mythical','Toxic cloud control and mutation.'],['Magnet','Mythical','Metallic orbit and magnetic pull.'],['Hellfire Gas','Mythical · Mutation','Infernal orange flame mutation; resonance builds over time and damage.']];
